  "details": "SDKv: VRCSDK3-UDON-2020.05.12.10.33_Public\nVrChatv: 2020.2.1p1\nWorld Tested: https://www.vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_1e8a44ad-e30d-4224-98d4-c946a7beab1e\nComputer Tested on: World runs at 90fps desktop with gtx 1050ti and cpu: intel i5-8300 Ram: 16gb's ddr4\nWhen player initialize world and enter the world with other players all players in the world lose 40-80 frames or freeze entirely for 0.5-2 seconds or longer if in vr, this also happens on load of avatar to the local user even out of site of that avatar (on the other side of the map) then returns back to 80-90 fps after loading of avatar. This also happens on avatar change if local user has not loaded the other users avatar before. This effect is compounded with more users in the world.\nAlso, when other avatars are in world even with occlusion culling, not looking at an avatar reduces frame rate by 5-10 frames.",
